      "content": "but \"just existing\" feels like a consolation prize for people who have already lost. i can't stand the thought of forty more years of just... being mediocre. it feels more like a punishment than a life. honestly, looking at the math of it all, if the potential isn't there, why continue the experiment? it feels like there's more dignity in stopping than in dragging out a life of being nothing special.",
